{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03756","headline":"石淙 · 李峤","name":"石淙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽盖龙旗下绝冥，兰除薜幄坐云扃。\n鸟和百籁疑调管，花发千岩似画屏。\n金竈浮烟朝漠漠，石牀寒水夜泠泠。\n自然碧洞窥仙境，何必丹丘是福庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03756.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03756","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}